WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.670
Start with the next action. The dashboard brings the most useful task to the top of the page.

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:17.420
Use role-specific navigation. Each workspace shows the tools and records relevant to that participant.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:24.170
Switch perspective safely. The workspace selector demonstrates another role without silently expanding permissions.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:30.920
Choose Learn whenever needed. Short procedures explain the responsible person, required actions and expected result.
